    "body": "When getaddrinfo returns an error, the output pointer is in an unknown state Don't call freeaddrinfo on it.  See the issue for discussion and details with links to reasoning.  _Most_ libc getaddrinfo implementations never modify the output pointer unless they are returning success.\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Sergey G. Brester <github@sebres.de>\r\nCo-authored-by: Oleg Iarygin <oleg@arhadthedev.net>\r\n\r\nThis re-does the earlier merged and reverted PR with some additional comments.\r\n\r\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-100795 -->\r\n* Issue: gh-100795\r\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\r\n",
